{"seq":4,"slug":"use-ref-and-imperative","title":"useRef 与命令式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/use-ref-and-imperative","wordCount":573,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"useref-与命令式\">useRef 与命令式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>useRef</code> 返回一个带 <code>current</code> 属性的可变对象，在组件整个生命周期内保持同一引用，修改 <code>ref.current</code> 不会触发重新渲染。它因此成为存放「不影响 UI 的可变数据」与获取 DOM 引用的标准手段。本章讲解 <code>useRef</code> 的本质、DOM 测量、<code>forwardRef</code> 转发、<code>useImperativeHandle</code> 暴露命令式接口，以及用 ref 保存最新回调、上一次值、定时器 ID 的稳定引用模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"useref-的本质\">useRef 的本质</h2><p><code>useRef</code> 返回一个包含 <code>current</code> 属性的可变对象，该对象在组件的整个生命周期内保持同一引用。与 <code>useState</code> 不同，修改 <code>ref.current</code> <strong>不会触发重新渲染</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph useState&#10;        S1[值变化] --&gt; S2[触发重新渲染]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[UI 更新]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph useRef&#10;        R1[值变化] --&gt; R2[仅修改 .current]&#10;        R2 --&gt; R3[不触发渲染]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph useState\n        S1[值变化] --&gt; S2[触发重新渲染]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[UI 更新]\n    end\n    subgraph useRef\n        R1[值变化] --&gt; R2[仅修改 .current]\n        R2 --&gt; R3[不触发渲染]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function mountRef&lt;T&gt;(initialValue: T): { current: T } {&#10;  const hook = mountWorkInProgressHook();&#10;  const ref = { current: initialValue };&#10;  hook.memoizedState = ref;&#10;  return ref;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function updateRef&lt;T&gt;(): { current: T } {&#10;  const hook = updateWorkInProgressHook();&#10;  return hook.memoizedState;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mountRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initialValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hook</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mountWorkInProgressHook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { current: initialValue };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hook.memoizedState </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hook</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateWorkInProgressHook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hook.memoizedState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>useState</th>\n<th>useRef</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>更新方式</td>\n<td><code>setState</code> 触发渲染</td>\n<td>直接赋值 <code>ref.current</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发渲染</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值的持久性</td>\n<td>跨渲染保持</td>\n<td>跨渲染保持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>驱动 UI 的数据</td>\n<td>不影响 UI 的数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dom-引用\">DOM 引用</h2><p><code>useRef</code> 最常见的用途是获取 DOM 元素的引用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function AutoFocusInput() {&#10;  const inputRef = useRef&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    inputRef.current?.focus();&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;input ref={inputRef} placeholder=&quot;自动聚焦&quot; /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function AutoFocusInput() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const inputRef = useRef&#x3C;HTMLInputElement>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    inputRef.current?.focus();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;input ref={inputRef} placeholder=\"自动聚焦\" />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dom-测量\">DOM 测量</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function MeasuredBox() {&#10;  const boxRef = useRef&lt;HTMLDivElement&gt;(null);&#10;  const [dimensions, setDimensions] = useState({ width: 0, height: 0 });&#10;&#10;  useLayoutEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (boxRef.current) {&#10;      const { width, height } = boxRef.current.getBoundingClientRect();&#10;      setDimensions({ width, height });&#10;    }&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;div ref={boxRef}&gt;内容&lt;/div&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;&#10;        宽度: {dimensions.width}px, 高度: {dimensions.height}px&#10;      &lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function MeasuredBox() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const boxRef = useRef&#x3C;HTMLDivElement>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [dimensions, setDimensions] = useState({ width: 0, height: 0 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useLayoutEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (boxRef.current) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const { width, height } = boxRef.current.getBoundingClientRect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setDimensions({ width, height });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div ref={boxRef}>内容&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        宽度: {dimensions.width}px, 高度: {dimensions.height}px</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"ref-forwarding\">Ref Forwarding</h2><p>函数组件默认不接受 <code>ref</code> 属性。使用 <code>forwardRef</code> 可以将 <code>ref</code> 转发到内部的 DOM 元素或子组件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface InputProps extends React.InputHTMLAttributes&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt; {&#10;  label: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const LabeledInput = forwardRef&lt;HTMLInputElement, InputProps&gt;(function LabeledInput({ label, ...props }, ref) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;label&gt;&#10;      {label}&#10;      &lt;input ref={ref} {...props} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/label&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});&#10;&#10;function Form() {&#10;  const inputRef = useRef&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;LabeledInput ref={inputRef} label=&quot;用户名&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; inputRef.current?.focus()}&gt;聚焦&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface InputProps extends React.InputHTMLAttributes&#x3C;HTMLInputElement> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  label: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const LabeledInput = forwardRef&#x3C;HTMLInputElement, InputProps>(function LabeledInput({ label, ...props }, ref) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;label></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {label}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input ref={ref} {...props} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/label></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Form() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const inputRef = useRef&#x3C;HTMLInputElement>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;LabeledInput ref={inputRef} label=\"用户名\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => inputRef.current?.focus()}>聚焦&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[父组件 Form] --&gt;|ref| B[&quot;forwardRef(LabeledInput)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|ref 转发| C[&quot;内部 input 元素&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;inputRef.current&quot;| C\">flowchart TD\n    A[父组件 Form] --&gt;|ref| B[\"forwardRef(LabeledInput)\"]\n    B --&gt;|ref 转发| C[\"内部 input 元素\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"inputRef.current\"| C</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> React 19 开始，函数组件可以直接接受 <code>ref</code> 作为 props，不再需要 <code>forwardRef</code> 包裹。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"useimperativehandle\">useImperativeHandle</h2><p><code>useImperativeHandle</code> 允许自定义暴露给父组件的 ref 值，而不是直接暴露 DOM 节点。这在构建可复用组件库时非常有用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface VideoPlayerHandle {&#10;  play: () =&gt; void;&#10;  pause: () =&gt; void;&#10;  seekTo: (time: number) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const VideoPlayer = forwardRef&lt;VideoPlayerHandle, { src: string }&gt;(function VideoPlayer({ src }, ref) {&#10;  const videoRef = useRef&lt;HTMLVideoElement&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  useImperativeHandle(&#10;    ref,&#10;    () =&gt; ({&#10;      play() {&#10;        videoRef.current?.play();&#10;      },&#10;      pause() {&#10;        videoRef.current?.pause();&#10;      },&#10;      seekTo(time: number) {&#10;        if (videoRef.current) {&#10;          videoRef.current.currentTime = time;&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;    }),&#10;    [],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return &lt;video ref={videoRef} src={src} /&gt;;&#10;});&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  const playerRef = useRef&lt;VideoPlayerHandle&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;VideoPlayer ref={playerRef} src=&quot;/video.mp4&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; playerRef.current?.play()}&gt;播放&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; playerRef.current?.pause()}&gt;暂停&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; playerRef.current?.seekTo(30)}&gt;跳到 30s&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface VideoPlayerHandle {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  play: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pause: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  seekTo: (time: number) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const VideoPlayer = forwardRef&#x3C;VideoPlayerHandle, { src: string }>(function VideoPlayer({ src }, ref) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const videoRef = useRef&#x3C;HTMLVideoElement>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useImperativeHandle(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ref,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      play() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        videoRef.current?.play();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      pause() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        videoRef.current?.pause();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      seekTo(time: number) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (videoRef.current) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          videoRef.current.currentTime = time;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;video ref={videoRef} src={src} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const playerRef = useRef&#x3C;VideoPlayerHandle>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;VideoPlayer ref={playerRef} src=\"/video.mp4\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => playerRef.current?.play()}>播放&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => playerRef.current?.pause()}>暂停&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => playerRef.current?.seekTo(30)}>跳到 30s&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>暴露内容</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接转发 ref</td>\n<td>完整 DOM 节点</td>\n<td>低（任意操作 DOM）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>useImperativeHandle</td>\n<td>自定义接口</td>\n<td>高（只暴露需要的方法）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"稳定引用模式\">稳定引用模式</h2><p><code>useRef</code> 常用于保存不应触发渲染的值，典型场景包括保存回调函数、定时器 ID、上一次的值：</p>\n<h3 id=\"保存最新回调\">保存最新回调</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function useEventCallback&lt;T extends (...args: any[]) =&gt; any&gt;(fn: T): T {&#10;  const ref = useRef(fn);&#10;&#10;  useLayoutEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    ref.current = fn;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return useCallback(((...args: any[]) =&gt; ref.current(...args)) as T, []);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) =&gt; void }) {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const stableOnSearch = useEventCallback(onSearch);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    const timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; stableOnSearch(query), 300);&#10;    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(timer);&#10;  }, [query, stableOnSearch]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;input value={query} onChange={(e) =&gt; setQuery(e.target.value)} /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function useEventCallback&#x3C;T extends (...args: any[]) => any>(fn: T): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ref = useRef(fn);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useLayoutEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ref.current = fn;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return useCallback(((...args: any[]) => ref.current(...args)) as T, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function SearchInput({ onSearch }: { onSearch: (query: string) => void }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [query, setQuery] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const stableOnSearch = useEventCallback(onSearch);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const timer = setTimeout(() => stableOnSearch(query), 300);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => clearTimeout(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [query, stableOnSearch]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;input value={query} onChange={(e) => setQuery(e.target.value)} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"保存上一次的值\">保存上一次的值</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function usePrevious&lt;T&gt;(value: T): T | undefined {&#10;  const ref = useRef&lt;T | undefined&gt;(undefined);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    ref.current = value;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return ref.current;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function Counter() {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);&#10;  const prevCount = usePrevious(count);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;&#10;        当前: {count}，上一次: {prevCount ?? &#39;无&#39;}&#10;      &lt;/p&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1)}&gt;+1&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function usePrevious&#x3C;T>(value: T): T | undefined {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const ref = useRef&#x3C;T | undefined>(undefined);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ref.current = value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return ref.current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Counter() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const prevCount = usePrevious(count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        当前: {count}，上一次: {prevCount ?? '无'}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => setCount((c) => c + 1)}>+1&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"保存定时器-id\">保存定时器 ID</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function useInterval(callback: () =&gt; void, delay: number | null) {&#10;  const savedCallback = useRef(callback);&#10;&#10;  useLayoutEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    savedCallback.current = callback;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (delay === null) return;&#10;    const id = setInterval(() =&gt; savedCallback.current(), delay);&#10;    return () =&gt; clearInterval(id);&#10;  }, [delay]);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function useInterval(callback: () => void, delay: number | null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const savedCallback = useRef(callback);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useLayoutEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    savedCallback.current = callback;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (delay === null) return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const id = setInterval(() => savedCallback.current(), delay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => clearInterval(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [delay]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;useRef 稳定引用&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;保存最新回调 → 避免 effect 依赖变化&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;保存上一次值 → 对比新旧状态&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;保存定时器 ID → cleanup 时清除&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;保存 DOM 元素 → 命令式操作&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"useRef 稳定引用\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"保存最新回调 → 避免 effect 依赖变化\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"保存上一次值 → 对比新旧状态\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"保存定时器 ID → cleanup 时清除\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"保存 DOM 元素 → 命令式操作\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>useRef</code> 返回跨渲染持久化的可变对象，修改 <code>.current</code> 不触发重渲染</li>\n<li>常用于获取 DOM 引用、保存定时器 ID、缓存最新回调等不影响 UI 的数据</li>\n<li><code>forwardRef</code> 将 ref 转发给子组件内部的 DOM 元素（React 19 后可直接用 props）</li>\n<li><code>useImperativeHandle</code> 自定义暴露给父组件的命令式接口，比直接暴露 DOM 更安全</li>\n<li><strong>稳定引用模式</strong> 通过 <code>useRef</code> 保存最新回调，配合 <code>useCallback</code> 创建不变的引用，解决 effect 依赖频繁变化的问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"useRef 与命令式","id":"useref-与命令式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"useRef 的本质","id":"useref-的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"DOM 引用","id":"dom-引用"},{"level":3,"text":"DOM 测量","id":"dom-测量"},{"level":2,"text":"Ref Forwarding","id":"ref-forwarding"},{"level":2,"text":"useImperativeHandle","id":"useimperativehandle"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定引用模式","id":"稳定引用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"保存最新回调","id":"保存最新回调"},{"level":3,"text":"保存上一次的值","id":"保存上一次的值"},{"level":3,"text":"保存定时器 ID","id":"保存定时器-id"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"useEffect 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/use-effect-deep-dive"},"next":{"title":"Context 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/context-patterns"}}